your clients or potential buyers.

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:53.560
I am launching a coffee brand called

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:55.360
Dream Brew, and when you buy it, we're

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:57.480
using the money to fund people's dreams

