00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:41.400
need to collect data. You need to

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:43.560
collect email addresses. Let me ask you

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:45.000
a question. On the website you've got,

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:46.720
have you got join my mailing list on

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:48.040
there? And you might be thinking, "Well,

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:49.400
I've got nothing to send them." Well,

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:51.120
you've got nobody signing up, so yeah,

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:52.760
you've got nothing to send them. But if

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.040
you don't have it on there, you've got

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:55.880
people visiting your website, you'll

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.960
never know who they are. Even with

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:59.080
social media, I've said it before, I'll

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:00.400
say it again. You should make sure every

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:02.720
single video that goes out on social

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:04.240
media actually involves people signing

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:06.040
up to your mailing list somehow. Point

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:07.974
I'm making is a lot of people don't

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:09.440
collect information on their customers.

00:13:07.974 --> 00:13:11.960
[music] They're not really spending the

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:14.839
time to understand what their customers

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:17.040
