00:13:14.839 --> 00:13:19.120
why they need them. One of the reasons

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:21.320
Amazon was so successful is because Jeff

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:22.760
Bezos asked his customer, "What do you

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:24.360
