00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:28.920
Turns out they also need window wipers.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:30.880
The point [music] is, without data

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:32.400
collected, you're never going to know.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:33.880
So, whatever you can do to collect data,

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:35.640
get an email address initially, and then

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:37.040
email them asking them questions, and

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:38.720
